  "details": "In the last few days, I've had Steam set to cause my system to run the open beta for VRChat.  Intermittently I've been seeing an odd behavior with the menu system.  When I click the B button the first menu appears normally.  When I then click any of the top row items (worlds, avatars, social, ...) the subsequent menu appears, but it's rotated about 80 degrees counterclockwise.  It's functional, but hard to read with that rotation.  When this does happen, the cure so far seems to be closing VRChat and then restarting it.",
